  m_text: 'Welcome to Order Up!


    You are a new delivery worker in town.

    Your
    job is to pick up food from the restaurant and deliver it to the correct customers.


    Complete
    deliveries to earn money and unlock new orders.


    Be careful! If you return
    to the restaurant without finishing your delivery,

    the boss might get annoyed!'
